║                                                                ║
║  Autentificare activată!                                      ║
║                                                                ║
║  Utilizatori demo:                                            ║
║    - admin / admin123     (acces complet)                     ║
║    - manager / manager123 (acces limitat)                     ║
║    - hr / hr123           (doar HR)                           ║
║    - finance / finance123 (doar Financiar)                    ║
║    - user1 / user123      (doar Public)                       ║
║                                                                ║
║  Workflow:                                                     ║
║    1. POST /login cu username + password                      ║
